  "question": "Complete the following Survo puzzle. In this 7*7 matrix:\n0 7 0 1 0 0 22\n6 0 0 0 0 2 36\n0 0 0 8 4 0 33\n0 0 6 0 0 0 33\n0 0 3 0 2 0 24\n0 0 4 0 2 0 28\n27 43 34 29 22 21 176\nthe cells marked with 0 need to be filled with numbers. The last number in each row and column equals the sum of all other numbers in that row or column. You can use the following numbers: [6, 7, 8, 3, 5, 6, 5, 9, 4, 4, 9, 2, 8, 5, 7, 3, 3, 1, 6, 6, 6, 8, 3, 5, 2]. Each number can only be used once.\n\nIMPORTANT: When you finish, put ONLY the final answer inside \\boxed{...} (no extra text). If the task requests a multi-line format, encode it into a single line representation.",
